### 25. SMAP Satellite Data & Soil Moisture Telemetry Retrieval
* **Endpoints Queried:**
  - NASA Earthdata CMR API (\https://cmr.earthdata.nasa.gov/search/granules.json?short_name=SPL3SMP_E&bounding_box=9.1,4.0,9.4,4.3\): Retrieved 5 live SMAP Enhanced Level-3 Soil Moisture granules for Buea coordinates.
  - NASA POWER API (\parameters=GWETTOP,GWETROOT,GWETPROF,EVPTRNS\): Extracted surface wetness (0-5cm) and root-zone wetness (0-100cm) time-series.
* **Results for Buea [4.155°N, 9.243°E]:**
  - Surface Soil Saturation: 81.0% - 84.0%
  - Root Zone Saturation: 77.0% - 80.0%
  - Evapotranspiration: 3.28 to 11.43 mm/day


